  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7265114aa1e7f41ada19d74a427f9e13, type: 3}
  m_Name: TimelineFlowCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples::xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.SampleCard
  Title: Timeline & Flow
  Try: 'Play the launch: the countdown, the charge, then press Launch inside the
    2 s wait (or let it launch itself). Pause, drag the slider, land it back mid-flight
    or from the top.'
  See: "Action1 flies: from the pad it plays, in flight it launches (outside the
    wait the signal is dropped); the mouse uses the buttons. One list (the Flight)
    shows the start rules \u2014 with previous, after previous, after all \u2014
    a stage loop \xD73 and a signal wait; its Player Control items start the endless
    Flame forward and stop it on the way back. Backward is a time mirror. Seek works
    on a nominal play only: an early Launch cuts the wait short and the play leaves
    its axis, so the slider stops. Loop count is the total passes; an item's repeat
    is extra runs. The bottom timeline is the sample's table of the list and its
    own clock \u2014 the play's position has no public read. Before leaves out the
    motion and the camera; the countdown, the pad light, the flame's show and the
    flow still run (out of every category)."
  Controls: "Space \xB7 1 \xB7 Gamepad South \u2014 play \xB7 launch \xB7 2 \xB7
    Gamepad West \u2014 pause \xB7 3 \xB7 Gamepad North \u2014 land \xB7 Z \xB7 X
    \xB7 D-pad \u2014 seek while paused \xB7 Mouse \u2014 buttons \xB7 slider"
  SceneGuid: 60e7784a54a6e4a518b43fb78d309d8d
  SceneName: TimelineFlow
  RequiredType: xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.Advanced.TimelineFlowLab, xpTURN.Feedback.Samples.Advanced.TimelineFlow
